===Etymology 1===
From {{der|en|enm|tyde}}, {{m|enm|tide}}, {{m|enm|tyd}}, {{m|enm|tid}}, from {{der|en|ang|tīd||time}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*tīdiz||time}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*déh₂itis||time}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*deh₂y-||to divide}}. Related to {{m|en|time}}.

